  "title": "1965 Imperial Crown: Rare and Lovely",
  "summary": "Imperial. A car apart. And once, a more than worthy competitor to Cadillac and Lincoln. Imperial, as a separate luxury car marque, only lasted from 1955 to 1975, with brief returns in 1981–83 and 1990–93. But the Fifties and Sixties Imperials, while rarely seen, were marvelous luxury cars. Today’s example is a case in point. […]",
